Z||000007||Seanh||10-21-2000||12:29 PM||||I had the same problem also, I figured out it works if you reload the topic list in the forum. Like when I post somthing, and it takes me to the topics replay page, I usally just hit "back" until I get to the topic list page. Then the thing I relpied to is at the top of the page, but when I click on it, I dont see my reply. Just hit the reload button then, and it will appear. Your computer stores the page in memory and then, to enable faster view in the future, displays that page in memory. After hitting reload it will work fine.<P>------------------<BR>Sean Heberly<BR>Silver 86 GT 2.8<BR>Killer Stereo System||||reg||1
